+---
+
+## Color Presets and Contrast Standards
+
+To preserve visual accessibility across dense boards, table rows, and state badges, 👍kanban standardizes on a curated palette of 12 WCAG AA compliant preset colors. Every color is calibrated to maintain a contrast ratio of at least 4.5:1 against light and dark background surfaces.
+
+### Curated 12-Color Preset Palette
+
+| Preset Name | Hex Code | Semantic Role / Recommendation |
+| :--- | :--- | :--- |
+| Slate | `#64748b` | Neutral states, archived workflows, backlog items |
+| Indigo | `#4f46e5` | System default fallback color for states, labels, and priorities |
+| Blue | `#2563eb` | Active workflows, started tasks, primary badges |
+| Cyan | `#0891b2` | Informational tags, technical debt, infrastructure |
+| Teal | `#0d9488` | Verification stages, documentation, secondary labels |
+| Emerald | `#059669` | Completed milestones, green builds, approved states |
+| Amber | `#d97706` | Warning stages, pending review, triage queues |
+| Orange | `#ea580c` | Medium priority items, fast-track workflows |
+| Rose | `#e11d48` | High priority tags, security advisories |
+| Red | `#dc2626` | Urgent blockers, canceled states, defect reports |
+| Purple | `#7c3aed` | Feature epics, release milestones, architecture tracks |
+| Pink | `#db2777` | UX and design initiatives, customer feedback |
+
+### Default Value and Custom Hex Input
+
+- **Default Fallback:** When a state, label, or priority is created without an explicit color selection, the system applies the default fallback `#4f46e5` (Indigo).
+- **Custom Hex Codes:** Teams requiring custom branding can input any valid 7-character `#RRGGBB` hexadecimal code via the advanced color picker or direct text input. Values are automatically normalized and validated.
+- **Contrast Guidance:** When entering custom colors, administrators should verify that text or badge foregrounds meet the WCAG AA minimum contrast ratio of 4.5:1 (or 3:1 for large badges) against surrounding surface containers in both Light and Dark themes.
